## Cloudflare Worker

- Worker: `binance-future-hunter`
- D1/KV di `wrangler.toml` bisa nunjuk resource lama (rebrand continuity) — tanya user sebelum `d1 create` / ganti `database_id`
- Urutan: `typecheck`+`test` hijau → `d1 migrations apply … --remote` → `wrangler deploy`
- Verify: `GET /` → `"name":"binance-future-hunter"`; tool via `POST /mcp`

## Bukan Docker

- **VPS produksi = AWS** (`svm-vps`, `13.212.7.132`, ap-southeast-1) — SSH via `~/.ssh/config` Host `svm-vps`
- Oracle (`146.235.17.228`) = historis; `fstream` di-black-hole dari IP Oracle, **bukan** dari IP AWS (Krakatau spike 2026-09-02)
- systemd: `whale-binance-proxy` + `whale-stream-gateway` + Caddy — proses terpisah
- `stream-gateway/install.sh` idempotent; Node 22+ (`node:sqlite`)
- Task B depth watch: pakai `wss://fstream.binance.com/ws/<symbol>@depth@100ms` dari AWS (verified ~588 msg/60s)

## proxy-standalone

- Target produksi: deploy ke **AWS VPS** (`proxy-standalone/` systemd) — Vercel relay = legacy/transisi
- Secrets Worker: `PROXY_URL`, `PROXY_SECRET` (origin VPS, bukan `/api/binance`)
- Jangan taruh logic pipeline di sini

